(parser-quirks)
*method rk4-fixed

# Deliberately preserves common legacy input quirks: flexible spacing, mixed
# case in names, underscores, and a trajectory whose first active segment is not one.
*trajectory  1   Interceptor  start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=1000 alt=0 lat=0 long=0 vel=1 gama=90 psi=90
  *segment 1 launch
    *when time>1 stop

*trajectory  2   2nd_Stg  start on 21
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=250 alt=0 lat=0 long=0 vel=1 gama=90 psi=90
  *segment 21 delayed-start
    *when time>1 stop
*end
